  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 31–40</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the notes. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Music and Hearing Restoration</h4><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Loss of a sense</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>People want pleasure from their senses and not only <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"31\" id=\"q31\" name=\"q31\" placeholder=\"31\" aria-label=\"Question 31\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>People are less interested in hearing things like alarms than in hearing music.</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Hearing loss</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>This often occurs in the inner ear (cochlea), specifically in the hair cells.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>In the past a hearing aid known as a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"32\" id=\"q32\" name=\"q32\" placeholder=\"32\" aria-label=\"Question 32\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> was used.</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Modern cochlear implant</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>This electrically stimulates nerves in the inner ear.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>It consists of two pieces:</div><div class=\"form-row indented\">− an internal part which is a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"33\" id=\"q33\" name=\"q33\" placeholder=\"33\" aria-label=\"Question 33\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\">− an external microphone part kept in position by a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"34\" id=\"q34\" name=\"q34\" placeholder=\"34\" aria-label=\"Question 34\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Benefits</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Example: one patient is able to take part in <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"35\" id=\"q35\" name=\"q35\" placeholder=\"35\" aria-label=\"Question 35\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> now.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Benefits are often experienced right away by adults.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Loud, medium, and soft sounds are perceivable.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Using the <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"36\" id=\"q36\" name=\"q36\" placeholder=\"36\" aria-label=\"Question 36\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> is possible for some people.</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Problems</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Many users do not get pleasure from the music they hear.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Users struggle to follow the notes’ <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"37\" id=\"q37\" name=\"q37\" placeholder=\"37\" aria-label=\"Question 37\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> in a tune.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Implant users cannot identify the notes from different types of <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"38\" id=\"q38\" name=\"q38\" placeholder=\"38\" aria-label=\"Question 38\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Future efforts</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Give people with implants <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"39\" id=\"q39\" name=\"q39\" placeholder=\"39\" aria-label=\"Question 39\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> in hearing music.</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Improve the <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"40\" id=\"q40\" name=\"q40\" placeholder=\"40\" aria-label=\"Question 40\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> used in implants</div></div>",
